ookbook:Corn|corn]]\n* 1 cup frozen [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]] [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:peas|peas]]\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Potato|potatoes]]\n* ½ cup diced [[Cookbook:Cucumber|cucumber]] pickles\n* 2 cups [[Cookbook:Mayonnaise|mayonnaise]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Boiling|Boil]] together the vegetables, then drain and transfer to a bowl.\n# Add the diced pickles and cool to room temperature.\n# Add the mayonnaise, and stir until uniformly mixed.\n# Finish by seasoning with some salt to taste.\n\n[[Category:Russian recipes]]\n[[Category:Armenian recipes]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using corn]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber pickles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mayonnaise]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Russian Salad","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup frozen corn","sourceText":"1 cup frozen corn","amountText":"1 cup frozen corn","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup frozen diced carrots","sourceText":"1 cup frozen diced carrots","amountText":"1 cup frozen diced carrots","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 cup peas","sourceText":"1 cup peas","amountText":"1 cup peas","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 cup potatoes","sourceText":"1 cup potatoes","amountText":"1 cup potatoes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ cup diced cucumber pickles","sourceText":"½ cup diced cucumber pickles","amountText":"½ cup diced cucumber pickles","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 cups mayonnaise","sourceText":"2 cups mayonnaise","amountText":"2 cups mayonnaise","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-l